## Product Validation Tests
@BASE_URL = http://localhost:5245
### Create Product with Invalid Name
POST {{BASE_URL}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "",
    "quantity": 0
}

### Create Product with Invalid Quantity
POST {{BASE_URL}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Valid Name",
    "quantity": 0
}
